# "Whenever another creature you control with power 2 or less enters, surveil 1." Bot1 (all on turn 1, off Mox Jet, Mox Ruby and
# Mox Emerald): the Gorehound entering asks nothing ("another"); the Memnite (power 1) and the Grizzly Bears (power 2, exactly
# the limit) each ask for a surveil - the Island on top goes to the graveyard, the Forest under it stays. Turn 2: Bot2's Memnite
# asks Bot1 nothing ("you control"). Turn 3: the Hill Giant (power 3, one over the limit) asks nothing either, and the Forest
# is Bot1's draw for the turn. Each "nothing" is pinned by the empty stack after the creature entered.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Snarling Gorehound
Memnite
Grizzly Bears
Hill Giant
Island
Forest
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Swamp x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Snarling Gorehound.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Island)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Forest | )
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hill Giant.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Hand = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Hill Giant.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Snarling Gorehound.Keywords = Menace
